WEBVTT

00:02.910 --> 00:07.790
To think I might be facing expulsion
as soon as I got to this school...

00:07.790 --> 00:11.500
I'm sorry I didn't say anything sooner.

00:11.500 --> 00:14.500
You really shouldn't be in our group.

00:14.500 --> 00:15.950
Why would a princess like yo—

00:16.790 --> 00:18.620
No formalities. Forget I'm a princess.

00:18.620 --> 00:21.750
I don't want everyone to be uptight around me.

00:21.750 --> 00:23.500
But...

00:23.500 --> 00:24.700
Please.

00:27.540 --> 00:28.750
All right.

00:28.750 --> 00:30.830
Thank you.

00:30.830 --> 00:34.950
Anyway, we won't be expelled
as long as we get points, right?

00:34.950 --> 00:39.080
Yes. As long as we're able to gain points
necessary from our grades from

00:39.080 --> 00:42.290
our classes, tests, as well as
extracurricular activities.

00:42.290 --> 00:44.700
I see.

00:44.700 --> 00:47.120
But you shouldn't think about it too much.

00:47.120 --> 00:48.790
Let's turn in for the night.

00:48.790 --> 00:51.200
Yeah, you're right.

00:51.200 --> 00:54.000
Good night.

00:57.830 --> 00:59.750
I'm going to turn off the lights.

00:59.750 --> 01:01.500
Oh, sure.

01:08.260 --> 01:13.590
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

01:08.260 --> 01:13.590
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

01:13.590 --> 01:18.090
Seven colours are not enough

01:13.590 --> 01:18.090
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

01:18.090 --> 01:23.760
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

01:18.090 --> 01:21.090
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

01:21.090 --> 01:23.760
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

01:23.760 --> 01:29.760
The story is going beyond

01:23.760 --> 01:29.760
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:33.930 --> 01:39.260
The bell toll in my heart

01:33.930 --> 01:39.260
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:39.260 --> 01:43.590
is getting louder bit by bit

01:39.260 --> 01:43.590
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:43.590 --> 01:47.090
Believe in the excitement

01:43.590 --> 01:47.090
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:47.090 --> 01:49.590
And take one step forward

01:47.090 --> 01:49.590
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:49.590 --> 01:56.920
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:49.590 --> 01:56.920
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:55.260 --> 01:57.920
Can't be for sure

01:55.260 --> 01:57.920
zettai nante nai

01:56.920 --> 01:59.590
Nothing

01:56.920 --> 01:59.590
nanimo

01:57.920 --> 02:00.590
There's no guarantee

01:57.920 --> 02:00.590
kakushin wa dekinai

01:59.590 --> 02:02.260
No one

01:59.590 --> 02:02.260
daremo

02:00.590 --> 02:03.260
But I won't give up

02:00.590 --> 02:03.260
demo akiramenai

02:02.260 --> 02:04.920
That's why

02:02.260 --> 02:04.920
dakara

02:03.260 --> 02:05.420
I can still move forward

02:03.260 --> 02:05.420
susundeku koto ga

02:05.250 --> 02:06.760
I can still move forward

02:05.250 --> 02:06.760
dekiru yo

02:06.760 --> 02:12.590
Because there's magic right in here

02:06.760 --> 02:12.590
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

02:12.590 --> 02:18.920
It started to be brighter than the stars

02:12.590 --> 02:18.920
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

02:18.920 --> 02:23.590
I can't stop now

02:18.920 --> 02:23.590
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

02:23.590 --> 02:29.260
It entered into a new era

02:23.590 --> 02:29.260
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

02:29.260 --> 02:33.590
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

02:29.260 --> 02:33.590
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:33.590 --> 02:37.260
And go beyond the future

02:33.590 --> 02:37.260
saki no hou e

02:44.290 --> 02:45.660
Good morning!

02:45.660 --> 02:48.620
Rise and shine! Time to get up!

02:54.040 --> 02:56.410
Tiara-san?

02:58.870 --> 03:03.950
Rosetta filled me in on everything!
Come on, let's go get those points!

03:03.950 --> 03:10.000
The creation of this academy is
a big part of Waleland's history.

03:10.000 --> 03:11.200
Two hundred years ago,

03:11.200 --> 03:13.870
a giant magical beast attacked,

03:13.870 --> 03:18.700
and the world was gripped with fear.
The great witch Flora...

03:14.240 --> 03:16.120
She's sure motivated.

03:16.120 --> 03:18.700
She said that she was going
to hold a study group after school.

03:18.700 --> 03:20.370
What?!

03:20.370 --> 03:22.040
Lavie-san, shh!

03:22.040 --> 03:26.120
No way! I'm not going to
study after school, too!

03:25.120 --> 03:26.120
You there!

03:27.080 --> 03:29.330
Ow! Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

03:29.330 --> 03:33.080
Silence, please. Minus three points.

03:36.540 --> 03:38.540
You've got this, Ashley!

03:38.540 --> 03:41.410
We'll get points as long as
you shoot right in the middle!

03:39.790 --> 03:44.540
Um, Tiara... You may be interfering
with her concentration...

03:41.410 --> 03:44.540
Don't worry! I'm sure you can
do it as long as you concentrate!

03:45.450 --> 03:47.500
And there goes some points.

03:49.620 --> 03:53.000
Lower your back a little more, Lyn-chan!

03:53.000 --> 03:54.700
Lavie's really good!

03:54.700 --> 03:57.750
She's great at sports, at least.

03:57.750 --> 04:00.080
Okay, my turn.

04:01.040 --> 04:02.950
Don't push yourself too much.

04:02.950 --> 04:04.870
Yeah, I know.

04:04.870 --> 04:07.500
Is Tiara good at sports?

04:07.500 --> 04:11.450
She used to be sick all the time,
so she wasn't really active.

04:11.450 --> 04:14.330
So if I had to choose...

04:15.830 --> 04:17.910
So she's not...

04:17.910 --> 04:19.910
Tiara!

04:25.250 --> 04:27.160
I guess it broke...

04:27.160 --> 04:29.080
Minus ten points.

04:29.830 --> 04:31.410
I see.

04:31.410 --> 04:34.660
Rather than going all out
for our classes and losing points,

04:34.660 --> 04:38.580
we need a good way of getting points.

04:38.580 --> 04:39.910
Correct...

04:39.910 --> 04:43.290
I can't believe you
figured it out already. Good job!

04:43.290 --> 04:46.410
But this is easier said than done...

04:55.700 --> 04:57.500
Things like that happen...

05:02.620 --> 05:04.830
Or we go too far...

05:04.830 --> 05:09.250
They're ready to take points
from us at any turn.

05:09.250 --> 05:14.040
Though in your case, most of your problems
would be solved if you'd just study.

05:14.040 --> 05:17.330
But I'm getting points other ways!

05:17.330 --> 05:19.410
I know it was Chloe-sensei's orders,

05:19.410 --> 05:22.540
but maybe you should ask to be
put in another group, Tiara-san.

05:22.540 --> 05:25.910
No, I really like this group.

05:25.910 --> 05:27.910
Is it because Rosetta's in this group?

05:27.910 --> 05:31.660
There's that, but it's fun
being with all of you.

05:31.660 --> 05:33.910
So I just want to be with you guys.

05:35.200 --> 05:37.500
You're making us blush.

05:39.000 --> 05:41.370
Rosetta sure is taking a while.

05:41.370 --> 05:45.500
Oh, Rosetta-san said she had something to do.

05:45.500 --> 05:46.230
Huh?

05:46.230 --> 05:48.620
She does have a habit
of disappearing at night.

05:48.620 --> 05:52.790
I heard that there were
extracurricular activities, so maybe it's that?

05:52.790 --> 05:56.450
No, I'm pretty sure Rosetta
doesn't belong to any club.

05:56.450 --> 05:59.250
I thought that she was
just shopping or something.

05:59.250 --> 06:01.250
She does do it quite often.

06:01.250 --> 06:02.950
I wonder what it is...

06:02.950 --> 06:05.080
It couldn't be...

06:05.080 --> 06:09.250
A girl who frequently sneaks off campus
as soon as the sun sets...

06:09.250 --> 06:10.290
I smell a mys—

06:10.290 --> 06:11.790
Could she secretly be meeting with someone?!

06:11.790 --> 06:15.250
Meating?! You mean Rose's
secretly having a hamburger?!

06:15.250 --> 06:17.120
Not that kind of meat.

06:17.120 --> 06:19.540
What other kind is there?

06:19.540 --> 06:23.910
What I'm saying is that it's not that kind of meat...

06:20.790 --> 06:23.910
But Rosetta would never
do something like that...

06:23.910 --> 06:27.830
The point is that we're going to
have to look into this further!

06:35.330 --> 06:37.160
I'm going to head out for a bit.

06:37.160 --> 06:40.040
Yeah, okay. Take all the time you need.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.290
Take all the time I need?

06:41.290 --> 06:43.370
Oh, it's nothing...

06:43.370 --> 06:45.000
Have a good time.

06:46.290 --> 06:47.370
Thanks.

07:11.700 --> 07:14.120
What do you lot think you're doing?

07:14.120 --> 07:16.120
Shh!

07:16.120 --> 07:17.910
What are you, ninjas?

07:34.160 --> 07:37.040
Things are getting really exciting!

07:37.040 --> 07:38.660
My heart's about to burst through my chest.

07:42.290 --> 07:43.370
What was that for—?!

07:43.370 --> 07:45.330
Shh!

07:45.330 --> 07:46.830
That's...

07:46.830 --> 07:47.870
Yes.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.660
Is something the matter?

07:51.660 --> 07:53.450
Oh, it's nothing.

07:53.450 --> 07:55.790
So that's who she's meeting with...

07:55.790 --> 07:57.580
But she's a girl...

07:57.580 --> 07:59.370
That doesn't matter!

07:59.370 --> 08:01.580
The more responsible someone may seem,
the amount of stress they have to deal with

08:01.580 --> 08:03.910
leads them to search for extreme forms of love!

08:05.080 --> 08:06.090
You seem to know a lot about this.

08:06.090 --> 08:08.120
This happens all the time in stories and—

08:08.120 --> 08:09.450
Hey, she's gone!

08:09.450 --> 08:10.660
Huh?!

08:14.370 --> 08:17.250
Looks like they're just acquaintances.

08:17.250 --> 08:19.250
She's totally gone!

08:23.450 --> 08:25.950
Sorry, this is all my fault.

08:25.950 --> 08:29.040
No, I lost sight of her, too.

08:29.040 --> 08:32.080
Yup. It's all Ashley's fault.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.080
Hey.

08:32.080 --> 08:35.200
Welcome! Oh. Hey, wait.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.290
Ratura.

08:36.290 --> 08:38.500
It's rare to see you here.

08:38.500 --> 08:39.620
Yeah.

08:39.620 --> 08:41.790
You gonna give us something on the house?

08:41.790 --> 08:44.290
Don't get your hopes up too much.

08:44.290 --> 08:46.120
Aw...

08:44.870 --> 08:46.120
You guys know her?

08:46.120 --> 08:47.750
Oh, let me introduce you.

08:47.750 --> 08:52.000
This is Ratura-san.
She's in the Lapis rank, just like us.

08:52.000 --> 08:55.040
I'm Tiara. I just transferred to the academy.

08:55.040 --> 08:58.160
Oh, so that's why I haven't
seen you around before.

08:58.160 --> 09:00.540
I'm Ratura. Pleased to meet ya.

09:05.830 --> 09:09.620
Thanks for waiting. Here's your
pale ale and your pescatore.

09:09.620 --> 09:12.330
You're as cute as ever, Ratura-chan.

09:12.330 --> 09:14.540
Well, duh!

09:15.540 --> 09:19.120
I guess she's studying to be
a witch and working part time.

09:19.120 --> 09:22.160
Apparently, Ratura-san comes
from a rich family,

09:22.160 --> 09:24.120
but she has very strict parents.

09:24.120 --> 09:28.200
She's always saying she doesn't
have enough spending money.

09:28.200 --> 09:30.250
So that's why she's working...

09:30.250 --> 09:34.160
I've never worked before,
but it must be really hard.

09:34.160 --> 09:37.250
It seems like she enjoys it, though.

09:37.250 --> 09:41.200
Perhaps... Rosetta-san is working, too.

09:41.200 --> 09:43.500
That's hard to imagine.

09:43.500 --> 09:45.000
Because she's a noble?

09:45.000 --> 09:46.410
You knew?

09:46.410 --> 09:48.410
You can tell just by looking at her.

09:48.410 --> 09:51.910
My father is the captain
of the Dordtgard knights.

09:51.910 --> 09:56.000
And because of that,
I've encountered a lot of nobles and royalty,

09:56.000 --> 09:57.120
so I could tell.

09:57.120 --> 09:58.950
You psychic, or something?

09:58.950 --> 10:01.870
It just means that she's very observant.

10:01.870 --> 10:03.660
You're a noble, too, aren't you, Tiara?

10:03.660 --> 10:07.750
Huh?! Yeah, uh... Something like that.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.040
I knew it.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.660
Wow...

10:11.790 --> 10:13.750
Thanks for waiting.

10:15.370 --> 10:16.660
Yay!

10:16.660 --> 10:18.870
When did you even order that?

10:18.870 --> 10:21.250
Well, I was hungry!

10:21.250 --> 10:23.540
You won't be able to eat dinner, then.

10:23.540 --> 10:25.580
I have a separate stomach for that!

10:25.580 --> 10:27.370
By the way, Ratura-san,

10:27.370 --> 10:29.700
have you seen Rosetta-san?

10:29.700 --> 10:31.830
Yeah, I just saw her.

10:31.830 --> 10:33.250
Where?! Where was she?!

10:33.250 --> 10:37.120
Huh...? Behind the shop.

10:40.160 --> 10:41.330
Huh?

10:42.290 --> 10:44.830
No, no, no!

10:44.830 --> 10:48.410
My precious Hamburg steak!

10:49.910 --> 10:53.910
According to Ratura-san,
she should be around here...

10:53.910 --> 10:55.870
My Hamburg steak...

10:57.660 --> 11:01.120
I'll treat you next time, okay?

11:01.120 --> 11:02.120
Really?!

11:02.120 --> 11:04.160
Yup! It's a promise!

11:04.160 --> 11:05.790
Yay!

11:05.790 --> 11:07.540
She knows what she's about.

11:07.540 --> 11:08.910
That's...

11:14.000 --> 11:16.290
R-Rosetta?

11:18.950 --> 11:20.580
Rose-chan is...

11:20.580 --> 11:22.200
...dumpster diving?

11:29.660 --> 11:31.660
Huh?

11:31.660 --> 11:33.200
Dumpster diving?

11:35.410 --> 11:37.040
Wait! You've got the wrong idea!

11:37.040 --> 11:39.830
I was just looking for Alfred.

11:39.830 --> 11:41.580
Alfred...?

11:41.580 --> 11:44.290
That must be who she's meeting with.

11:44.290 --> 11:45.790
Meeting?

11:45.790 --> 11:46.750
Huh?

11:50.450 --> 11:53.660
You were looking for a duck that escaped?!

11:53.660 --> 11:58.660
I've actually been working multiple
part-time jobs. I'm a pet sitter today.

11:58.660 --> 12:01.540
But why are you working?

12:01.540 --> 12:02.950
Well...

12:02.950 --> 12:06.500
Oh, hey. I think I saw it earlier—
that duck of yours.

12:06.500 --> 12:08.040
Wait, where?!

12:08.040 --> 12:09.620
Right in front of the café over there.

12:09.620 --> 12:10.530
Thanks!

12:10.530 --> 12:12.290
Wait! We'll help!

12:12.290 --> 12:15.120
No! I can't let you
do anything like that, Tiara!

12:15.120 --> 12:16.080
But...

12:16.080 --> 12:19.200
I'll be fine on my own.

12:19.200 --> 12:21.500
You guys can head back to the academy.

12:21.500 --> 12:22.660
Rosetta!

12:23.700 --> 12:25.910
Ashley?

12:25.910 --> 12:29.120
It's like the old Rosetta-san...

12:30.410 --> 12:31.750
What do you mean?

12:31.750 --> 12:35.000
Rosetta used to bury herself in her studies.

12:35.000 --> 12:40.450
She tried way too hard to get
good grades and it just backfired.

12:40.450 --> 12:44.370
And because of that, she ended up
clashing with other students...

12:44.370 --> 12:46.160
I thought we were finally able to

12:46.160 --> 12:49.370
help each other out
when we joined the same group.

12:49.370 --> 12:53.120
I want to help you, Rosetta-san!

12:53.120 --> 12:54.750
Lynette...

12:54.750 --> 12:58.620
Well, you show me your homework all the time.

12:58.620 --> 12:59.910
Lavie...

13:01.040 --> 13:03.790
Friends should always help each other out.

13:03.790 --> 13:05.080
Ashley...

13:06.750 --> 13:08.290
Rosetta.

13:10.330 --> 13:11.660
Okay.

13:15.000 --> 13:17.410
Thank you, everyone.

13:18.910 --> 13:20.540
I guess that settles it.

13:20.540 --> 13:21.620
Yeah!

13:21.620 --> 13:22.660
Leave it to us.

13:22.660 --> 13:24.830
We'll find him in no time if we work together.

13:24.830 --> 13:27.120
Where do ducks like to go?

13:27.120 --> 13:28.540
Let's split up.

13:28.540 --> 13:30.160
Good idea.

13:35.410 --> 13:38.330
So, why did you start working?

13:39.200 --> 13:42.580
Well... So...

13:42.580 --> 13:46.870
Two years ago, my family ran into
some trouble, and our savings ran dry.

13:46.870 --> 13:48.120
What?!

13:48.120 --> 13:49.660
But it's okay.

13:49.660 --> 13:54.450
We still have our titles as nobles,
but we're making enough to get by.

13:54.450 --> 13:57.370
But...

13:57.370 --> 14:01.120
I think our family prefers
to live without constraints,

14:01.120 --> 14:03.500
and I really don't have any problems with it.

14:03.500 --> 14:06.870
I'm having a lot of fun now,
so don't worry about it, okay?

14:06.870 --> 14:12.120
Okay... I understand. But if there's
ever anything troubling you,

14:12.120 --> 14:14.950
don't hesitate to tell me, okay?
It's a promise.

14:14.950 --> 14:17.540
Yes, I promise.

14:20.410 --> 14:21.790
We still haven't found it.

14:21.790 --> 14:23.870
Maybe there isn't a duck after all.

14:23.870 --> 14:26.040
But you saw it, didn't you?

14:26.040 --> 14:27.370
Oh, yeah.

14:27.370 --> 14:29.750
Uh, hey...

14:35.830 --> 14:37.160
There it is!

14:37.160 --> 14:38.370
Let's catch it!

14:39.700 --> 14:42.500
Hold it right there, Alfred!

14:42.500 --> 14:44.750
You're way too fast...

14:49.910 --> 14:51.200
Let's surround it!

14:51.200 --> 14:52.200
Got it!

14:53.370 --> 14:55.370
Lynette, this way!

14:55.370 --> 14:57.700
Okay...

14:57.700 --> 15:02.200
Where could've Alfred run off to...?

15:02.200 --> 15:04.540
This takes me back.

15:04.540 --> 15:05.540
Huh?

15:05.540 --> 15:11.870
Remember when you sneaked me out of
the castle when we were little?

15:15.120 --> 15:17.870
Jeez! Hold it!

15:16.580 --> 15:17.870
Tia!

15:19.540 --> 15:21.700
And then I took a tumble...

15:25.040 --> 15:27.870
Pain, pain, go away!

15:27.870 --> 15:31.040
Look, all better! This owie's all better!

15:31.040 --> 15:34.870
You're okay now. I cast a spell
so it won't hurt anymore.

15:36.450 --> 15:39.500
Yeah! Thanks, Rose!

15:39.500 --> 15:43.540
I'm sorry for letting you get hurt back then.

15:43.540 --> 15:45.410
I was happy, though.

15:46.450 --> 15:49.200
Because we got to play together in the town.

15:49.200 --> 15:50.620
Tiara...

15:53.950 --> 15:56.500
Ugh, why are you so fast?!

15:59.290 --> 16:01.950
Perfect! Ashley and Lynette are over there!

16:01.950 --> 16:04.120
Griffin Workshop's newest creation!

16:04.120 --> 16:07.000
How cute are you?!

16:07.000 --> 16:08.500
Ashley!

16:08.500 --> 16:10.120
Sorry! I couldn't help myself!

16:10.120 --> 16:12.250
Damn it! In that case, Lyn-chan...

16:13.910 --> 16:16.830
Unbelievable! This magical tome is so rare!

16:16.830 --> 16:17.970
I must buy it

16:17.970 --> 16:19.750
Lyn-chan...?

16:22.830 --> 16:24.160
Oh hi, Rosetta.

16:24.160 --> 16:26.580
This is really good.

16:26.580 --> 16:28.870
And, it was on the house.

16:28.870 --> 16:31.120
Would you like one, too, little lady?

16:31.120 --> 16:36.330
Maybe next time. By the way,
did you happen to see a duck?

16:36.330 --> 16:38.830
Huh? A duck?

16:38.830 --> 16:41.250
Hold it right there, Alflex!

16:41.250 --> 16:42.660
Tiara!
Got it!

16:44.410 --> 16:47.450
Please wait...

16:47.450 --> 16:49.330
I wonder what all that's about.

16:49.330 --> 16:50.410
No idea.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.950
We've got you now, Alford!

16:56.950 --> 17:00.200
On the count of three, we'll all grab him!

17:00.200 --> 17:01.620
Okay.

17:01.620 --> 17:03.580
One, two...

17:03.580 --> 17:05.160
Hold it.

17:05.160 --> 17:07.160
Are we going to jump him
while you say three,

17:07.160 --> 17:09.120
or jump him right after you say three?

17:09.120 --> 17:10.200
Which is it?

17:10.200 --> 17:11.370
As I say it, obviously.

17:11.370 --> 17:13.450
Wait, it's not after?

17:13.450 --> 17:16.200
That doesn't matter! Just hurry!

17:16.200 --> 17:17.830
Okay, let's just go!

17:17.830 --> 17:20.620
One, two, three!

17:27.580 --> 17:29.500
Tia!

